( print_gid_mesh_activate_gravity [6.985] -yes, the global default of
 control_print_gid_mesh_activate_gravity: every element in the
 .flavia.msh and in every element result.
 Model: a column of four quad4 [y 0-1, 1-2, 2-3, 3-4] built by
 mesh_activate_gravity_time 10 0. 1.: element i
 starts its activation at t = [i-1]/4.
 build_safe.sh runs it in a scratch copy and checks the element numbers
 of the .flavia.msh and of each element_group block of the .flavia.res
 against the Professional 02-08-2026. )
echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 2
materi_velocity
materi_stress
end_initia
node 1 0 0
node 2 1 0
node 3 0 1
node 4 1 1
node 5 0 2
node 6 1 2
node 7 0 3
node 8 1 3
node 9 0 4
node 10 1 4
element 1 -quad4 1 2 3 4
element 2 -quad4 3 4 5 6
element 3 -quad4 5 6 7 8
element 4 -quad4 7 8 9 10
group_type 0 -materi
group_materi_elasti_young 0 1.e3
group_materi_elasti_poisson 0 0.2
group_materi_density 0 1.
bounda_dof 0 1 -velx -vely
bounda_dof 1 2 -velx -vely
force_gravity 0. -10.
mesh_activate_gravity_time 10 0. 1.
control_timestep 10 0.25 1.
control_print_gid 10 -yes
print_gid_mesh_activate_gravity -yes
end_data
